      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Resolve <a href=\"../MongoTransactionOptions.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb\"><code>MongoTransactionOptions</code></a> from a given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/TransactionDefinition.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.transaction\"><code>TransactionDefinition</code></a> by evaluating\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/interceptor/TransactionAttribute.html#getLabels()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.transaction.interceptor\"><code>TransactionAttribute.getLabels()</code></a> labels if possible.",
      "translation": "根据给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/TransactionDefinition.html\" title=\"类或接口在 org.springframework.transaction\"><code>TransactionDefinition</code></a> 解析出 <a href=\"../MongoTransactionOptions.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb 中的接口\"><code>MongoTransactionOptions</code></a>，如果可能的话，通过评估 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/interceptor/TransactionAttribute.html#getLabels()\" title=\"类或接口在 org.springframework.transaction.interceptor\"><code>TransactionAttribute.getLabels()</code></a> 的标签来实现。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "A <code>TransactionOptionResolver</code> reading MongoDB specific <a href=\"../MongoTransactionOptions.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb\"><code>transaction options</code></a> from\na <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/TransactionDefinition.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.transaction\"><code>TransactionDefinition</code></a>.",
      "translation": "一个 <code>TransactionOptionResolver</code>，用于从 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/TransactionDefinition.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.transaction\"><code>TransactionDefinition</code></a> 读取 MongoDB 特定的 <a href=\"../MongoTransactionOptions.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb\"><code>事务选项</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new <a href=\"../MongoTransactionManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb\"><code>MongoTransactionManager</code></a> obtaining sessions from the given <a href=\"../MongoDatabaseFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb\"><code>MongoDatabaseFactory</code></a>\napplying the given <code>options</code>, if present, when starting a new transaction.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的<a href=\"../MongoTransactionManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb\"><code>MongoTransactionManager</code></a>，从给定的<a href=\"../MongoDatabaseFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb\"><code>MongoDatabaseFactory</code></a>获取会话，并在启动新事务时应用给定的<code>options</code>（如果存在）。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new <a href=\"../ReactiveMongoTransactionManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb\"><code>ReactiveMongoTransactionManager</code></a> obtaining sessions from the given\n<a href=\"../ReactiveMongoDatabaseFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb\"><code>ReactiveMongoDatabaseFactory</code></a> applying the given <code>options</code>, if present, when\nstarting a new transaction.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的<a href=\"../ReactiveMongoTransactionManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb\"><code>ReactiveMongoTransactionManager</code></a>，该管理器从给定的<a href=\"../ReactiveMongoDatabaseFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb\"><code>ReactiveMongoDatabaseFactory</code></a>获取会话。如果在启动新事务时提供了<code>options</code>，则应用这些选项。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Convert the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> into an instance of <a href=\"../MongoTransactionOptions.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb\"><code>MongoTransactionOptions</code></a>.",
      "translation": "将给定的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>转换为<a href=\"../MongoTransactionOptions.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb\"><code>MongoTransactionOptions</code></a>的实例。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Factory method to wrap given MongoDB driver native <code>TransactionOptions</code> into <a href=\"../MongoTransactionOptions.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb\"><code>MongoTransactionOptions</code></a>.",
      "translation": "工厂方法，用于将给定的 MongoDB 驱动程序的本地<code>TransactionOptions</code>包装到<a href=\"../MongoTransactionOptions.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb 中的接口\"><code>MongoTransactionOptions</code></a>中。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Apply the current options using the given mapping <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Function.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Function</code></a> and return its result.",
      "translation": "使用给定的映射应用当前选项，该映射为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Function.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Function</code></a>（java.util.function 中的类或接口），并返回其结果。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Spring Data's MongoDB abstraction.",
      "translation": "Spring Data 对 MongoDB 的抽象。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Value Object representing empty options enforcing client defaults.",
      "translation": "表示空选项的值对象，用于强制客户端默认值。",
